{
  "date": "2026-10-19",
  "title": "What the Leader Rewards",
  "scriptures": [
    {
      "ref": "1 Samuel 16:7",
      "text": "People look at the outward appearance, but the LORD looks at the heart."
    },
    {
      "ref": "Matthew 6:1",
      "text": "Be careful not to practice your righteousness in front of others to be seen by them."
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "the_battle_before_the_battle",
      "label": "The Battle Before the Battle",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Your stated values describe the culture you want. Your rewards reveal the culture you are actually building."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_revelation",
      "label": "The Revelation",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Imagine an organization says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“People first.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But promotions consistently go to people who produce results while destroying relationships."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "What did the organization actually teach?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Results first."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A church says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“Character matters.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But gifted leaders repeatedly receive exceptions because they’re effective."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "What did the church teach?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Gift matters more."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A family says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“Tell the truth.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But honesty gets punished while appearance gets protected."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "What did the family teach?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "LOOK GOOD."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "Culture eventually believes what leadership repeatedly rewards."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_lie",
      "label": "The Lie",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“PEOPLE KNOW WHAT WE VALUE BECAUSE WE TOLD THEM.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "No."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "People watch."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Who gets promoted?",
            "Who gets access?",
            "Who gets praised?",
            "Who gets protected?",
            "Who receives exceptions?",
            "Who gets invited back?",
            "Who receives the microphone?",
            "What behavior produces opportunity?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Those answers teach the actual values."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "PEOPLE READ INCENTIVES MORE CAREFULLY THAN MISSION STATEMENTS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_truth",
      "label": "The Truth",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WHAT GETS REWARDED GETS REHEARSED."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Reward something repeatedly and people begin adapting toward it."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "If only visible results receive praise,",
            "invisible faithfulness becomes less attractive."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "If charisma gets opportunity,",
            "character may become secondary."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "If constant availability gets rewarded,",
            "boundaries begin looking like disloyalty."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "If aggressive personalities advance,",
            "gentleness begins looking weak."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "If leaders protect high performers from consequences,",
            "everyone learns:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "RESULTS CAN PURCHASE EXEMPTION."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Now culture is being discipled."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "jesus_reorders_reward",
      "label": "Jesus Reorders Reward",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Matthew 6 repeatedly exposes people doing good things:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "giving.",
            "praying.",
            "fasting."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But doing them:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“to be seen….”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Jesus asks:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "WHOSE REWARD ARE YOU SEEKING?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kingdom formation changes what receives honor."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not merely visibility.",
            "Faithfulness."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not merely charisma.",
            "Character."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not merely results.",
            "Obedience."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not merely impressive gifts.",
            "Fruit."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Not merely who can build the biggest platform."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "WHO CAN BE TRUSTED WHEN NOBODY IS WATCHING?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_leadership_audit",
      "label": "The Leadership Audit",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "items": [
            "WHO GETS PROMOTED HERE?",
            "WHY?",
            "WHAT BEHAVIOR GETS ACCESS?",
            "WHO RECEIVES EXCEPTIONS?",
            "WHAT DO I PRAISE PUBLICLY?",
            "WHAT DO I OVERLOOK BECAUSE SOMEONE PRODUCES RESULTS?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Then:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "IF EVERYONE COPIED THE PEOPLE I REWARD, WHAT KIND OF CULTURE WOULD WE HAVE?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That’s the test."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_surrender",
      "label": "The Surrender",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Look for something worth rewarding that normally goes unnoticed."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Integrity.",
            "Quiet service.",
            "Repentance.",
            "Keeping a promise.",
            "Developing someone else.",
            "Telling difficult truth.",
            "Protecting the team.",
            "Giving away credit.",
            "Faithfulness without applause."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Then:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "HONOR IT."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Because leadership doesn’t only correct culture."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Leadership teaches culture what deserves celebration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "take_it_with_you",
      "label": "Take It With You",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "Your stated values describe the culture you want. Your rewards reveal the culture you are actually building."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_prayer",
      "label": "The Prayer",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Father,"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Show me where my rewards contradict my words."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Keep me from being impressed by what You are not impressed by."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Give me eyes for character."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Faithfulness.",
            "Humility.",
            "Truth.",
            "Service.",
            "Courage."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Help me reward what helps people become more like Christ."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "In Jesus name,",
            "Amen."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "hidden_gems",
      "label": "Hidden Gems 💎",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "People read incentives more carefully than mission statements."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "What gets rewarded gets rehearsed."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Results must never purchase exemption from character."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "If everyone copied the people I reward, what kind of culture would we have?"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Leadership teaches culture what deserves celebration."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "-TheWrkShop"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "__insert_block_header": "2026-10-19_1-samuel-16-7_what-the-leader-rewards|"
}
